            "sid": "JOS 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abantu bairamu bati: “Tituja kuleka Musengwa Katonda ni tugheereza bakatonda bandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda waife n'eyatoola badhaadha baife, n'ife beene, mu Misiri ye twalinga mu bwiru, era n'eyakola ebyewuunhisa ebikologho nga tubona. Yatukuumanga bukalamu eyo yoonayoona ye twabitanga, era yaatubisanga bukalamu mu maghanga goonagoona ge twabitamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabingangho Abamori abaabanga ghano. Kale twena twidha kugheerezanga Musengwa Katonda, kuba oyo ni Katonda waife.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Yoshua yaakoba abantu ati: “Timusobola kugheereza Musengwa Katonda, kuba oyo ni Katonda omutukuvu era Katonda ow'enkikidi. Taja kubasonigha kwonoona kwaimwe oba ebibi bye mukola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe mumuvaaku ni mugheereza bakatonda ab'amaghanga agandi be basinza, aja kukyusa abakole bubi inho abazikirize, abe ng'oti tabangaku mulungi ye muli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baakoba Yoshua bati: “Busa, ife tuja kugheerezanga Musengwa Katonda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua yaabakoba ati: “Oba nga beene musazeegho okugheereza Musengwa Katonda, imwe beene niimwe abadhulizi b'ekyo kye musazeegho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baamwiramu bati: “Yii, bwenebwene tuli badhulizi baakyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
