            "sid": "JOS 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli baagheerezanga Musengwa Katonda ekiseera kyonakyona Yoshua kye yamala ng'ali kubakulembera, era n'ekiseera ekyairirira kye baamala nga bakulemberwa abakulu ab'ebikunsu Yoshua be yalekagho. Abakulu abo n'abaamanha ebyo byonabyona Musengwa Katonda bye yakolera Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
